t"><b>&lt;125°F</b><span>maximum cylinder storage temperature</span></div><div class="stat"><b>15 min</b><span>integrated-cylinder alert: duration below this warns you</span></div></div></div></header><nav class="jump" aria-label="Chapters sections"><div class="row"><a href="#ch40">Chapter 40 ↓</a><a href="#ch41">Chapter 41 ↓</a><span class="navlabel">Ch 40:</span><a href="#ch40-basics">1 · Aerosol Basics</a><a href="#ch40-size">2 · Particle Size</a><a href="#ch40-deposition">3 · Deposition</a><a href="#ch40-targets">4 · Targets & Aging</a><a href="#ch40-measure">5 · Measuring & Hazards</a><a href="#ch40-pmdi">6 · pMDI</a><a href="#ch40-smi-dpi">7 · SMI & DPI</a><a href="#ch40-jets">8 · Jet Nebulizers</a><a href="#ch40-smart">9 · Smart Nebulizers</a><a href="#ch40-kids">10 · Kids & Protocols</a><a href="#ch40-special">11 · Special Circumstances</a><a href="#ch40-quiz">Ch 40 Self-Test</a><a href="#ch40-strip">Ch 40 Memory Strip</a><span class="navlabel">Ch 41:</span><a href="#ch41-intro">1 · Introduction</a><a href="#ch41-gases">2 · Gas Characteristics</a><a href="#ch41-production">3 · O₂ Production</a><a href="#ch41-cylinders">4 · Cylinders</a><a href="#ch41-handling">5 · Storage, Transport & Use</a><a href="#ch41-bulk">6 · Bulk Oxygen</a><a href="#ch41-distribution">7 · Distribution & Connectors</a><a href="#ch41-flowmeters">8 · Flowmeters</a><a href="#ch41-quiz">Ch 41 Self-Test</a><a href="#ch41-strip">Ch 41 Memory Strip</a><a href="#quiz-guide">Quiz Study Guide</a><div class="toggle"><span>Recall:</span><button id="ch40-recallBtn" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Ch 40: Hide the numbers</button><button id="ch41-recallBtn" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Ch 41: Hide the numbers</button></div></div></nav><div id="ch40">





