      <li><b>CBT: 5–20 mg/h, q30min × 2 h, PEFR +10%, goal 50%.</b></li>
      <li><b>Vent: SVN/USN/VM/pMDI + adapter; &gt;15% at 0–6 in from the Y; VM beats SVN in NIV; heliox 80:20; HFOV &gt;10%.</b></li>
