    <div class="flow" style="margin-top:14px"><span class="step">Filter room air</span><span class="arr">&rarr;</span><span class="step">Liquefy it (Joule&ndash;Thompson)</span><span class="arr">&rarr;</span><span class="step">Boil off the nitrogen</span><span class="arr">&rarr;</span><span class="step">Liquid oxygen left</span></div>
