        <button type="button" class="opt">A chemical reaction</button>
      </div>
      <p class="why">A concentrator is physical gas separation: room air passes through molecular sieve beds that trap the nitrogen, so concentrated oxygen comes through. No liquid oxygen, no distillation column.</p>
