        <button type="button" class="opt">Liquefy the nitrogen &rarr; filter the oxygen &rarr; boil it off</button>
        <button type="button" class="opt" data-qg-correct="1">Filter the air &rarr; liquefy it &rarr; boil off the nitrogen</button>
        <button type="button" class="opt">Filter the nitrogen &rarr; liquefy the oxygen &rarr; boil off the air</button>
      </div>
      <p class="why">Filter, liquefy (Joule&ndash;Thompson cooling), then boil off the nitrogen &mdash; nitrogen boils first, leaving liquid oxygen behind.</p>
